        "id": "515089",
        "date_added": "2026-10-25 07:00:09",
        "twitter_handle": null,
        "display_name": null,
        "comment": "Static .NET configuration and resolver analysis, 2026-10-25 UTC. SHA-256 verified; complete 63,488-byte PE32 CLI assembly, metadata v4.0.30319. The njRAT-style initializer (MethodDef 0x06000011, RVA 0x2134) populates the blogs array with eight exact ads.txt URLs at IL offsets 0x17 through 0x4f, then stores blogs at IL 0x55. GetFailbackEndpoint (RVA 0x5a34) reads/shuffles the configured URLs and queues endpoint-resolution work. CheckBloggerLive (RVA 0x5788) creates an HTTP request, reads and trims its response, splits it on comma (character 44) and parses the port. CheckOneUrl (RVA 0x5e44) calls the resolver/probe routines and stores foundHost/foundPort, then persists last-good state. Thus these are configured C2 dead-drop/resolver URLs, not eight independently observed socket C2 servers and not demonstrated executable-download URLs. Configured list: https://24-09-2026.pages.dev/bachkhoahn/ads.txt ; https://24-09-2026.edgeone.dev/bachkhoahn/ads.txt ; https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mekong20252026/24-09-2026/refs/heads/main/bachkhoahn/ads.txt ; https://24-09-2026.neocities.org/bachkhoahn/ads.txt ; https://bachkhoahn1111.blogspot.com/ads.txt ; http://proxycheap.for.ru/uploads/28916/13237/bachkhoahn/ads.txt ; https://24-09-2026.clan.su/bachkhoahn/ads.txt ; https://gitlab.com/24-09-2026-group1/24-09-2026/-/raw/main/bachkhoahn/ads.txt . Shared hosting/service parent domains are not blanket malicious indicators. The configured pages were not fetched and their current contents, resolved host/port and availability remain unverified. Plugin code at RVA 0x4e6c calls Assembly.Load/GetModules/GetTypes/CreateInstance, consistent with the upstream njRAT label and the surrounding RAT-style command/camera methods. No assembly loading, .NET execution, plugin execution, C2-page retrieval or socket connection was performed. No passwords or private keys are included."
      }
